---
// The evening of docs/produit.md, "Pour qui", told by the evening rather than by the child's faults: not knowing where to
// start, no one to help, or everyone tired; that organisation can be learned, docs/methode.md, "À retenir". One large
// column on the brand's light plane, at the size of a section title, its lines rising one after the other, from further
// down than elsewhere: the section's strong moment.
---

<section class="plane-tint py-28 md:py-32 lg:py-40">
  <play-once class="strong container block max-w-4xl">
    <h2 class="section-title text-foreground">
      <span data-reveal="rise" class="block font-extrabold">
        18&nbsp;h. Le cartable est ouvert, l&apos;agenda aussi, et rien n&apos;a commencé.
      </span>
      <span data-reveal="rise" data-order="2" class="block text-primary">
        Personne n&apos;est là pour aider, ou tout le monde est déjà fatigué.
      </span>
    </h2>
    <p data-reveal="rise" data-order="3" class="mt-6 text-xl text-foreground lg:mt-8 lg:text-2xl">
      Souvent, ce n&apos;est pas la leçon qui bloque, c&apos;est par où commencer. Et ça s&apos;apprend.
    </p>
  </play-once>
</section>

<style>
  .strong {
    --motion-distance: var(--motion-distance-strong);
  }
</style>
